Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=42}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's here to save us!
Comment: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of the Seven Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:28.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:30.23,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down, ignorant peasants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:35.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only came to your pathetic\Nlittle town for that pirate's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:36.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And modest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He comes and saves us,\Nbut he won't take the credit for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three cheers for Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The guardian angel of Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King of the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You peasants can call me\Nwhatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:02:59.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You pirates should have stayed\Nout of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now you're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey! I think\Nyou're underestimating us a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, are you gonna take us all on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of us\Nand only one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you're just\Nthe government's little dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are,\Nacting like a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For those who wish\Nto live, lie down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!\NPerfect for target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:24.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every last berry in this town is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a pathetic puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm. I'm a puppet, huh?\NI don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:17.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,idiot pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:28.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's leaving now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:43.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Crocodile! Crocodile!\N– Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:59.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Crocodile! Crocodile!\N– Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1410)}Looks like he beat us here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seems like he's always\None step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By the time we arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the pirates had already\Nbeen taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as the citizens are safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}Crocodile has been a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:25.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've almost made it to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't look away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want you to look me in the eyes\Nright now and tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No idea what you mean, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:43.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything! No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did enough food\Nfor eight people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}which I carefully divided up so that\Nit would last until we reached Alabasta,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,suddenly go missing\Nin the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lying is pointless,\Nso just tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have a terrible poker face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it looks like you have\Nsomething around your mouth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I forgot about the crumbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:10.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, we need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need a better way of keeping\Nthe food safe from Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:26.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can we please buy\Na refrigerator that locks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since it could be a matter\Nof life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we really do need\Nto catch something for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how's the fishing going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... well, it's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't take my eyes off anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... I'm so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the fish aren't biting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?! You do realize\Nthis is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You ate all the bait that we had!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fish aren't ever gonna bite\Nif we don't give them a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you ate some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... I only ate a little bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what was stuck to the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! So, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Catch anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think we could catch a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:34.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't know. I really\Nwant to catch a sea king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop fishing with\Nmy duck, you jerks!
Comment: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}that{\i0} stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys wait here. I'll go get Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, there's something\Nwrong! Come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:09.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:11.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.\NIt's just a little steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:14.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're saying that steam's\Ncoming up out of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.\NA hot spot, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's a hot spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An area of the sea\Nwhere magma's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Below the steam over there\Nis an undersea volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are volcanoes...\Nunderneath the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, there are actually\Nmore volcanoes under the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than there are on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, I guess we can't eat\Nthe steam then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There'll be a brand-new island\Nover there, thanks to the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the process will take\Ntens of thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:43.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:47.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder if {\i1}I{\i0} can live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd plan on dying\Nsometime before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you caught anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're so hungry.\NCan't you cook us something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys are just hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'll go search\Nthe storage area anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to see if we have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yuck! It smells like sulfur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:18.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.\NThere's steam everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just bear with it. We should\Nbe out of the steam soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Mr. 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:25.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch\Nof smoke at twelve o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid\Nof some smoke! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! We're going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We made it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 has completely disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:50.90,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's check the cabin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:55.91,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2! Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of these days, I need to stop\Njumping on every random duck I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here,\Nplease! I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die\Nthere for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:40.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never imagined\Nmy life would be saved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by a group of complete strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Although, could I trouble you\Nfor a cup of warm soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:52.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chicken noodle will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– No way!\N– No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't even feed ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:11:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey... You're just\Nan absolute cutie, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. He's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, uh... you really can't swim, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! You see,\NI ate a devil fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:10.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I can't swim even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What kind of fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, since I can't go anywhere\Nuntil my ship picks me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no harm in a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For saving my life, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, get ready.\NThis is my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you–
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.25,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all just\Nfor a little fun, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.17,0:11:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey now... {\i1}mean guy{\i0}! Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun, fun, fun, fun, fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if I touch my face\Nwith my left hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that is the power of\Nthe Clone-Clone Devil Fruit, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The body and the voice\Nmatch perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:12:00.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, and you, and you, and you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.35,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! Just wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:05.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There! But honestly, I didn't really\Nhave to slap you around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay! Now watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I have to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is touch my right hand to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I can mimic anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not all. I can change...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bodies too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, guy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm terribly sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but... I shouldn't demonstrate\Nmy power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– No, please do more!\N– Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! If you absolutely insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I can show a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's really hamming it up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:44.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I have\Nsomething even more incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm equipped with a memory feature!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ohh...\N– Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:12:58.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Oh, wow...\N– Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And around and around\Nand around we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is just boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And twirl! Open {\i1}plié{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, did everyone enjoy\Nmy very special secret talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's quite impressive,\Nbut I almost never show it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Oh, yeah!\N– Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– ♪ It's too good to be true! ♪\N– ♪ It's too good to be true! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.49,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's too good to be tru-uh-oh! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.02,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ It's too good to be true! ♪
Comment: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.16,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}♪ Yeah! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:34.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– No!\N– No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you can't leave! Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try not to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Journeys must always\Ninclude farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:46.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And yet, I will never\Nforget you or today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been brief...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:52.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but true friendship\Nisn't determined by time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:54.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See you, cool guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:00.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, quickly, let's be going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, Mr. 2! Mr. Bon Clay, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr... 2?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy... is... Mr. 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! You mean you didn't\Nknow him just by looking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. I've never met Mr. 2\Nor Mr. 1 and his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know much\Nabout any of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or what their powers may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Though I have heard\Nrumors about them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've heard about Mr. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's a very tall ballerina
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who talks like a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)}And he always wears a swan coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}The coat says\N"Bon Clay" on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– You didn't know?!\N– You didn't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw something in his memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the faces that he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of those faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,belonged to my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:57.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cobra Nefertari...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my father, the king of Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he can mimic the face\Nof a king that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 has the potential\Nto cause a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like we let a really bad guy\Nget away today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, that guy is our enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems so, and having him on\Nthe other side is not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:20.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If Mr. 2 realizes that we're\Nthe ones Baroque Works is after,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:24.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}then he can use the memories he got\Nearlier to transform into any one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:28.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't even be able\Nto trust our own friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's slow, but he's right\Nnot to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:40.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out on this one,\Nand I think you'll agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.17,0:15:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's actually a good thing\Nthat we ran into Mr. 2 when we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because now we can prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:47.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we can beat him\Nat his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:51.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure seem to be in a particularly\Ngood mood for some reason, Mr. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:50.14,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Un{\i0}, {\i1}deux{\i0}, {\i1}trois{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:51.93,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}how do you say four again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It just so happens,\NI made some new friends today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That thing is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like food to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:22.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now... if we can just\Nget there alive, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Food for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's backing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reverse! Put the boat in reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! We can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't let it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the two of you\Ndon't capture it, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:42.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then, sea kitten!\NHow do you think I should cook you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:51.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, what are you doing? I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why...? Just why? It was food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because you can't eat a sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just can't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sea cats are sacred\Nanimals in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are more animals\Nin the ocean than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're still scared of that stuff,\Nthen you have a long way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So! Let me tell you about\Nthe time that{\i1} I, Usopp,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:13.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}single-handedly fought off the sea kings\Nof the Calm Belt, young Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sea kings? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And big ones too!\NMan, they were really huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All our food got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't worry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to stuff\Nyourself full really soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Really? Will we get\Nanother cat to eat, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:32.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! The wind and weather\Nseem to be stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. We're entering\Nthe climate area of Alabasta island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seeing a sea cat come out\Nof the water is proof as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And those things you see\Nbehind us over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are all the proof I need\Nthat we're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of ships, huh?\NWho are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:01.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all flying the Baroque Works\Nsymbol on their mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks as if all the Baroque Works\Nemployees have started gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that\Nthese are the billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:10.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're the subordinates\Nunder the officer agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:14.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means that there are\Nat least 200 enemies waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The best that Baroque Works has\Nto offer. The elite of the underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This group will surely be a lot better\Nthan the bounty hunters at Whiskey Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's blow 'em all away!\NIf we're lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.42,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}we can get rid of all of them\Nbefore they get too close, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:30.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be quicker if we just\Ngo over there and beat 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, though.\NI need to eat something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:35.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, they're not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We need to keep our eyes on the prize\Nor we might lose this altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, 8 against 200 sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just make sure and tie it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone fooled\Nby the enemy's disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll always know\Nwho our friends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... look for\Nthe bandage on their arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:58.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This Clone-Clone Fruit guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:02.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... is he that similar\Nwhen he turns into someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the same, not just similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was crazy! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shoulda seen it, Sanji.\NHe changed into every one of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even Nami, and then\Nwe got to dance with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:14.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know that someone\Nwith his powers is among the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so we need to be really careful\Nto be on our guard at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what should {\i1}I{\i0} do to help\Nagainst this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever it is you {\i1}can{\i0} do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not expected\Nto do anything more, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if you get overwhelmed,\Nthen just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:32.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the pep talk\Nhe's always giving himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is I {\i1}can{\i0} do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see the island now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's stop at the town\Ncalled Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to hide the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. No matter what happens\Non that island, remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:48.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this thing on all our arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is a sign of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now! Let's land, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, and help Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– That's a side note?\N– That's a side note?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, remember, our enemy\Nis a whole gang of assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just try to think before\Nyou do anything stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, really, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,7,,{\fad(500,0)}Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:21.80,Main-207-,,0,0,7,,What's everybody looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't know. They said some guy just\Ndropped dead sitting up at the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:29.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our food's never been\N{\i1}that{\i0} bad before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... someone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he suddenly dropped dead\Nright in the middle of the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just died?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he just up and keeled over\Nduring a conversation with the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:43.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He isn't from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We think he may have accidentally\Neaten a desert strawberry while traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,not knowing what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is a desert strawberry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a species\Nof poisonous spiders
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:55.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that look like red strawberries\Ngrowing in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyone who eats one\Nwill suddenly die a few days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The infection spreads\Nthroughout the corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it's contagious,\Nso no one can go near.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a quick but unpleasant way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to be careful in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything you touch can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But just look at the way his arm\Nis still stuck up like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,holding on to a bite of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's proof of just how swiftly\Nthe desert strawberry acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an incredibly deadly creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He came back to life!
Comment: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:32.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um... are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:40.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– You were asleep?!\N– You were asleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were right in the middle\Nof a conversation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now you're just eating\Nlike nothing happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what's all\Nthe commotion about, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We thought you had dropped dead!\NAre you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:22:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does this restaurant of yours\Ndo comedy skits or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. That isn't our thing, not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're just glad that you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Damn it! Cut it out!\N– Damn it! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every time he falls asleep\N someone thinks he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:14.77,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, it turns out\Nhe wasn't dead after all?
Comment: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think that oughta do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.79,0:22:30.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you by any chance\Nseen this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:34.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate that wears a straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve, eating in\Nthe middle of a public place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even for a division commander\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,7,,Hello, Portgas D. Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!\NNot the Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd seen that mark\Non his back before!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean this weirdo is\None of the Whitebeard Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:59.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the mark\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:04.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's such a big-shot pirate\Ndoing in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:19.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My little brother.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=43}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=36}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
